window.products.push({"id":620085,"name":"Curved Shower Curtain Rod 35 × 35 Inch,Rustproof Stainless Steel Wall Mount L Shaped Shower Rods for Bathroom,Corner,Closet,Stall,Hardware Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bvllhqybL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for a strong and durable shower curtain rod at a lower price? No drill curtain rod might be popular for not using an electric drill to install,but it is easy to fall down in a humid environment.But,our shower curtain rod curved is your ideal choice.Made of rust proof stainless steel,this l shaped shower rod will never corrode and collapse easily,thus is able to withstand the steamy bathroom environment all the time. What are included in the package? 1× Installation Instruction,1 × rod connector,2 × shower rod,2 × round bracket,2 × round cover,6 × wall anchor,6 × screw Material: Stainless Steel Dimension: 35 × 35 Inch Color: Silver Features: ①This l shaped shower curtain rod covers a wall area of 35 × 35 inches,giving you more space in the shower. ②Shower curtain can move freely along the shower rod without the interference of ceiling support,ideal for full enclosure and preventing water from spreading everywhere. ③With hardware and installation instruction included,it only takes 15 minutes to have your new shower curtain rod ready to use in no time. ④This curved shower curtain rod can be used in many places,such as bathtub,bathroom,bedroom,living room,corner,closet,stall,clothing store,etc. How to install? 1️⃣Connect and adjust the shower rods to an appropriate horizontal position. 2️⃣Mark the position for screw holes. 3️⃣Drill holes for 5MM in diameter in the wall. 4️⃣Insert wall anchors into the holes. 5️⃣Put the round bracket on the wall and screw it with a tool. 6️⃣Put the round cover through the end of shower rod and insert it to the fixed round bracket on the wall,then cover it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71bvllhqybL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SENHE","source_asin":"B08GKTZ38C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GKTZ38C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GKTZ38C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
