window.products.push({"id":620087,"name":"kuangMEIX Silicone Kitchen Sink Mat Dish Drying Mat Sink with Rear Drain Protect Sink from Stains, Scratches, Dishwasher Safe Sink Dish Rack Easy to D","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kahh10KBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1. Food grade silicone material: kitchen sink mat Made of soft food grade silicone material, so it can be rolled up or folded very easily, anti-slip effect is very good, for glass and ceramic or stainless steel tableware have cushion impact, to provide good protection, the sink mat coincides with the side of the sink, provide protection for your tableware. 2. HEAT RESISTANT: The kitchen sink mat is an excellent heat resistant mat, heat resistant up to 500F or 260°C, so the kitchen sink mat can effectively insulate and safely place pots and pans on the sink mat. 3. Bottom elevated design: The hollowed out non-slip and raised feet elevate the kitchen sink mat with drainage holes that allow small food particles and water to pass through it, and can also be used as a dish drying mat under the sink, with a sink drain in the middle or side of the kitchen sink grid that fits the center drain hole of most kitchen sinks. 4. Easy to clean: This silicone sink mat can be rinsed directly or washed in the dishwasher, you can wash it directly with water to mention the stain and it will become very clean again, in addition, another benefit of silicone material is rust resistance. 5. MULTIPLE USES: This sink mat comes in three colors, gray, black as well as green, with standard and large sizes for you to choose from, the silicone mat can be used on kitchen counters or sinks, as a liner for refrigerators or drawers, insulation mat, non-slip pet food mat, etc","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61kahh10KBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kuangMEIX","source_asin":"B0BSD9NDV9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620087","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSD9NDV9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSD9NDV9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":620088,"name":"Personalized London England Ornament – Polyresin Travel Ornaments – Unique U.K. Ornaments 2022 – Christmas Vacation Ornament – United Kingdom Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c91OqJO-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Quality Travel Christmas Ornaments – Unlike other Holiday décor that breaks and falls apart in a matter of weeks. Our London ornament is durable and lightweight for lasting quality and easy hanging on the family tree for a special twinkle in your ornament tree décor! Vibrant colors and elegant details of london landmarks. This Holiday season, bring back your great travel memories around the world and celebrate one of the world's best cities with this travel ornament! Expert Artist Personalization – Other cruise, beach, landmarks, travel ornaments and Christmas decorations often arrive with messy, clumsy personalization (or worse, the wrong name). Our talented in-house artists handwrite each personalization to your exact specifications using custom paint pens imported from Germany. Every travel ornament 2022 is delicately hand painted to ensure its unique appearance for a ONE-OF-A-KIND travel ornament for Christmas tree you’ll always cherish. Celebrate Life’s Biggest Moments – Cherish your favorite memories and commemorate those incredible vacations and special moments spent with your loved ones that you want to remember most. Crafted with festive details and vibrant colors and personalized to your specifications, your unique travel decorations will make your Christmas tree feel extra special and unique to your family home. This season, give the gift of joy! 24-Hour Order Processing – Our travel ornaments make beautiful london souvenirs and gifts to cherish every Holiday season. Your London UK ornament will arrive ready for gifting, nestled in tissue paper with a Gift Box, Gift Bag and Gift Tag – no need for wrapping! The perfect London gifts, London decor, travel theme decor and around the world ornaments for world travelers to create loving and lasting memories that will surely be cherished forever! Happy Travelers – At Holiday Traditions, we’re dedicated to crafting beautiful London decorations and travel themed gifts to celebrate the holidays – and their love for each other. Having been in business for over 17 years, creating and personalizing over 640,000 Christmas tree ornaments along the way, we’re experts in quality craftsmanship. If for any reason you don’t love your London Christmas ornament, please reach out to us directly so we can make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c91OqJO-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holiday Traditions","source_asin":"B08HSWH77Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620088","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HSWH77Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HSWH77Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
