window.products.push({"id":620134,"name":"Symylife Lift Chair Electric Recliner to Best Dad Ever, Power Lift Recliner with Side Pocket and Heated and Massage, with Fabric Sofa Motorized and US","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FnhgmsbdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Power lift chiar to best dad ever】-Our chair lift can push the whole chair up to help the elderly stand up easily without increasing the pressure on the back or knees. The lifting process is quiet and no noise is generated. Our reclining chair The recliner can be tilted to 160 degrees, and the footrest and backrest can be extended or retracted at the same time. You can smoothly adjust to a custom position and stop lifting or tilting wherever you want. 【Lift chairs with heating and massage】-This chair has 4 massage areas (back, waist, thigh, calf) and 5 modes (pulse, press, wave, automatic, normal). An additional USB charging port allows you to charge the device while sitting or lying down. With the best comfort function, it is very suitable for reading, sleeping or nap.Which can provide the most comfortable enjoy to your father on Father’s Day(Note: The USB port is only suitable for low-power devices such as phones, iPads or headsets.) [Comfortable Elderly Electric Massage Chair]-With Powder-free sponge cotton padding, backrest and cushion padding will bring you a more comfortable feeling, just like the whole body is wrapped in the chair. The treated fabric surface will bring a warm and soft touch, and has a certain anti-pilling and anti-pilling effect.Best gift choice for dad, and you are deserve to have . [Safe material] - We insist on choosing environmentally friendly timber with higher production costs in order to offer more safety. The durable metal frame of the base gives this chair stability and strength. 【Easy assembly】 - Come with assemble & use instructions. If any shipping damage when it arrive or defective during usage, please feel free to write us, we will provide best solution in 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FnhgmsbdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Symylife","source_asin":"B091T9833F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620134","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091T9833F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091T9833F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
