window.products.push({"id":620184,"name":"Black & Decker GC200B Gizmo Electric Can Opener, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ex9xa3voL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Don't spend another minute fussing with tricky can openers. The Black & Decker Gizmo Cordless Can Opener attaches to any size can and instantly cuts around the lip, turning off when done. No cords. No hands. Just a clean cut in seconds. Store in the mountable base, in a drawer or on a countertop. Opens a month's worth of cans on one charge. Blade is dishwasher safe. Imported. Amazon.com Offering three storage options, this cleverly designed appliance is not only convenient, it turns the chore of opening cans into a hands-free operation that's as fun as it is effective. The opener is cordless so it goes anywhere, eliminating the need to carry a can to a countertop or mounted electric opener. Simply clamp the opener onto any size can and let go of the soft-grip top. The opener then walks around the can on its own, shutting off automatically when the can is open. A swing-out magnet lifts the lid free. The opener is lightweight and recharges in a compact, 6-3/4-by-5-1/2-inch plastic charging base that can be mounted on a wall (mounting hardware included), set on the counter, or placed in a drawer. For easy cleaning, the removable, stainless-steel blade is dishwasher-safe. --Fred Brack From the Manufacturer With the Gizmo cordless can opener, open cans anywhere: over a sink, at the stove, or at a pet's bowl. Enjoy the freedom of flexible storage: in the mountable base, in a drawer, or on a counter. The can opener \"walks around\" the can and shuts off automatically. At full charge, it opens up to a month's worth of cans. The removable power-pierce blade is dishwasher safe for easy cleanup. Lid release function offers easy, safe disposal of lids into a wastebasket. The Gizmo cordless can opener can also be used as a Spacemaker under-cabinet can opener. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ex9xa3voL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACK+DECKER","source_asin":"B0006N8OD6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006N8OD6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006N8OD6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
