window.products.push({"id":620266,"name":"iMounTEK Projection Alarm Clock 7.7In Mirror LED Digital Alarm Clock w/Dual Alarms 6 Levels & Automatic Brightness Snooze Function 6 Dimmer Night Ligh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sUjNIKOSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Clear Time Projection: With 180° rotatable projection corner, our alarm clock for bedroom can project ultra-clear time onto wall or ceiling. The best projection distance is 6.56-16.4ft. No need to turn your head to check the time. Besides, you can adjust the brightness (Low/High) according to your needs. Dual Alarms With Snooze Function: Featured with 2 separate alarms, conveniently set an appropriate time to separate your waking-up time from your partner on the same day. Snooze function allows 5-60 minutes (Default 5Mins) of sleeping time before alerting you again. USB Charging Port & Memory Function: With a USB output port, very convenient for your phone to charge when sleeping. A CR2032 button battery (Not Included) allows for time memory during power outages. 6 Levels & Auto Brightness: If select \"AU\" mode, the LED display will automatically change its brightness according to the environment. Or you can choose 6 stable brightness as your needs. You can also set night mode for electricity saving(Default time is 18:00-6: 00). Mirror Surface Clock: With an HD surface of 7.28x3.03in, you can use the clock as a mirror for your makeup while watching the time. And you can just wipe with a single rub to keep the surface clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61sUjNIKOSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iMounTEK","source_asin":"B0C4KWX2KG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4KWX2KG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4KWX2KG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
