window.products.push({"id":620301,"name":"Yamazaki Hafnia 43-Piece Flatware Set, Service for 8","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ctpmlYpLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Yamazaki's Hafnia is Scandinavian in inspiration and refined for today’s best tables, this remarkable design has graced homes for decades. Functional artistry at its best, our polished collection of unique full-featured patterns has been designed to distinctly complement both your everyday as well as more formal needs. Amazon.com Sleek and stylish, Hafnia flatware from Yamazaki suits a modern setting and offers a fun counterpoint to a traditional table. Each piece features a swooping handle with a narrow neck, arced profile, and raised tip. The scoop design looks airy and whimsical, but proves remarkably balanced both on the table and in the hand. Crafted from 18/8 stainless steel, with knife blades made of high carbon cutlery steel, this satin-finish flatware adeptly combines beauty and durability. The 42-piece set includes eight complete place settings, each with a 6-1/2-inch salad fork, a 7-1/2-inch dinner fork, an 8-1/4-inch knife, a 7-inch soupspoon, and a 6-inch teaspoon. The 2-piece serving set offers a tablespoon and a cold meat fork. The entire collection is easily stored in the included wooden caddy. Hafnia is safe in the dishwasher and backed by a lifetime guarantee against defects. --Kara Karll What's in the Box 8 place settings, 2 serving pieces. Each place setting consists of: 6-1/2-inch salad fork; 7-1/2-inch dinner fork; 8-1/4-inch knife; 7-inch soupspoon; 6-inch teaspoon. Service set consists of: 1 tablespoon; 1 cold meat fork. 42 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ctpmlYpLL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yamazaki","source_asin":"B0006OMW8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620301","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0006OMW8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0006OMW8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":620302,"name":"Calibowl Del Mar Stack Plastic Single Serving Bowls, Red, Set of 5","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i9wdP853L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The CaliBowl was designed in California and born in the surf! It's a bowl that has a patent pending revolutionary lip around the top. It's designed at an angle which pushes food onto your utensil avoiding any spillage and overflows. Like a wave in the ocean the lip pitches the food onto your desired utensil/chip or any eating medium. Whether its chips & salsa or any other type of food the versatility of the CaliBowl lends itself to endless applications. As the contents are forced to the side of the CaliBowl, the enhancement causes a gradual wave like recirculation back toward the CaliBowl’s center obtaining a no spill result. Whether you are using a chip, a spoon, chop sticks, your hand, or any other utensil the CaliBowl not only prevents the contents from spilling, but effortlessly guides the contents back toward the utensil making eating, mixing, feeding, cooking, whipping, and scooping more fun and exciting! The CaliBowl Del Mar Stack consists of 5 red plastic single seriving 1 cup bowls with the CaliBowl no-spill lip. These one cup bowls meet your every day needs and they are perfect for just about anything- from feeding a baby to serving condiments. The bowls are made of food grade Polypropylene, making them exceptionally durable and shatterproof, and feature a non skid base. They are microwavable and top rack dishwasher safe and the sleek design makes for easy cleaning. They are BPA free and manufactured using partially recycled material","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81i9wdP853L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CaliBowl","source_asin":"B002VPCX8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002VPCX8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002VPCX8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
