window.products.push({"id":620565,"name":"Vanilla Potpourri Refresher Oil","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6114QTpzL+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our signature oils in their pure potent form. The bottle holds 1/2 oz of Our Vanilla Potpourri Oil and is smooth and rich. It has notes of fresh cream, vanilla bean, and sugar. Open your home and kitchen to a delightfully warm and delicious fragrance. A quietly inviting and relaxing aroma.Just a drop or two is all you will need to revitalize your potpourri. At Barn Owl Botanicals, all of our potpourri and botanical products are handmade right on our farm in Lancaster County, Pennsylvania. We got our start in 2016, and with hundreds of satisfied customers, demand for our handcrafted botanical products allowed us expand our online presence. If you’re looking for the highest quality potpourri and rosehips mixtures available, you’ve landed in the right place! Our plethora of different potpourri and rosehips mixtures are available in so many different amazing scents. Please note: this “refresher” oil is for refreshing the aroma of potpourri and is NOT to be used as an essential oil. This oil is NOT to be used in electric diffusers and sprayed into the air. However, they are safe to use as a reed diffuser, wax melters, regular potpourri, and simmering potpourri. Please avoid contact with skin. The best way to refresh your potpourri: 1. Put the potpourri into a ziplock bag 2. Add a few drops of refresher oil 3. Shake and for the best results let some air out of the bag and let the potpourri sit in the bag for apx. 1 hour so the botanicals can absorb the oil. 4. Return the potpourri to its dish and enjoy!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6114QTpzL+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barn Owl Botanicals","source_asin":"B09MNTFHB4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620565","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MNTFHB4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MNTFHB4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
