window.products.push({"id":620781,"name":"AOSSA Piercing Pillow for Side Sleepers Ear Protector CNH Pillow with Ear Holes for Pressure Sores Ear Pain Relief Headphones Donut Pillow for Head Ea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.88,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lZZwuLqoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Piercing Pillow for Side Sleepers Ear Protector cnh Pillow with Ear Holes for Pressure Sores Ear Pain Relief Headphones Donut Pillow for Head Ear Cushion Side Sleeping Pillow (Blue) Do you feel uncomfortable when your ears are squeezed while you sleep? Do you have a new cartilage piercing? Are you struggling with otitis? Do you like listening to music or wearing earplugs while you sleep? Therefore, we specially designed this three-hole ear protector pillow. You can enjoy painless sleep from now on! Main Function ● Allow air to circulate freely, providing uncompressed space for side sleepers with headphones, earplugs and pierced ears. ● Relieves earaches, otitis, CNH and ear pressure sores. ● Avoid pillow direct contact with wound to speed up postoperative recovery. Product Specification Material：flannel, PP cotton Colour：blue Size：overall 19.6 * 9.4\" (ear holes 3.5 * 3.5\") Why Choose Us? Skin friendly & Non-irritating - The pillow cover of ear hole pillow is made of flannel fabric, soft, moisture-absorbing and durable. Stable Support - PP cotton lining, high resilience, reusable, no deformation. Three-hole Design - The piercing pillow has three evenly distributed 3.5 \"diameter ear holes so that you can find the right place to put your ears no matter how you tossing and turning in the bed. Curved Design - The side sleeper pillow naturally fits the neck and shoulder curve to support the head and neck for a more comfortable sleep free from stress and soreness. Adjustable - An invisible zipper on the side of the ear canal pillow allows you to adjust your optimal sleep height by adding or removing padding. Detachable - Pillowcase can be removed for cleaning to keep face or ears clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lZZwuLqoL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOSSA","source_asin":"B0B38W45PK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B38W45PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B38W45PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
