window.products.push({"id":620833,"name":"Fundamental Rockhound Products: 1 pc Fire Agate Tumbled Stone Gemstone Crystal with Carrying Pouch, info Card, Stone Certification (Large (8-15 g))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91F-+dCbjQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metaphysically, Fire agates are found in the American Southwest and northern Mexico. They are basically chalcedony colored with iron oxide. The American Indians treasured these stones and used them for jewelry, believing they kept evil away from the wearer. They also were used to protect one from natural enemies: fire and lightning. Today, Europeans use fire agates in children's cribs to protect them from crib death and respiratory arrest (for the first eight weeks). The stones are hung in a medicine bag over the sleeping area. (if considering this, I would suggest combining it with blue chalcedony) Fire Agate can have a harmonizing effect on both the body and mind by keeping one's mood in check, by keeping one who is accustomed to violent outbursts of temper or fits or rage, calm.. WARNING WARNING STONES MUST NEVER BE LEFT LOOSE AROUND SMALL CHILDREN UNDER 6 YEARS OF AGE AS THEY COULD BE CHOKING HAZARDS. STONES MUST BE SECURED IN A KNOTTED MEDICINE BAG OR SECURELY WRAPPED IN JEWELRY THAT COULD NOT COME LOOSE .. ...... Disclaimer: .... The information regarding metaphysical and other properties and purposes of these stones is provided for entertainment purposes only. It is not intended for diagnosing illness, prescribing treatment, or advice, and should not replace proper medical attention. Consult your Doctor or other health care practitioner regarding health issues. We are not liable for any use or misuse of this information.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91F-+dCbjQS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Fundamental Rockhound","source_asin":"B017MF7NEQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620833","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017MF7NEQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017MF7NEQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
