window.products.push({"id":620962,"name":"Large Rainbow Herringbone Hooded Grass Basket","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T11xokGfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"* Large size basket* Colorful herringbone pattern* Hanging side handles and hooded lid* Made from grass and colorful recycled plastic ribbons* Approx. 12\" widest diameter, 16\" without hood, 21\" height with hood* Each basket is hand woven, expect 1.5\" variations in dimensions* Uses traditional coil style weaving technique* Weavers use varying colored plastic ribbons* Handwoven by Wolof women* Made in Senegal --------------------- The Wolof people in Senegal are known for weaving colorful baskets from locally harvested cattail stalks and strips of plastic. They weave handmade baskets of different sizes and shapes over banter and shared laughs. These groups of women empower themselves and their tribe through the practice of this traditional craft.  Dakar, Senegal's capital city, is filled with many craft markets and artisan groups like the Wolof Women. The Wolof women are strong-willed and independent women. They are challenging patriarchal norms by becoming income earners in their households. The Wolof women bond over a mutual interest to eradicate poverty and provide better opportunities for their younger ones. This coil style of basket weaving has been practiced in Senegal for generations. The technique has been preserved by Wolof women by teaching their daughters and nieces. Traditionally, baskets were woven by binding thick local grass with thin strips of palm frond. Palm fronds were difficult to work with and were hard on the weavers' hands. So, recycled plastic ribbons were introduced to replace palm fronds. This simple change in material greatly reduced discomfort during the weaving process. Our collection Senegalo is a curated collection of colorful baskets, bowls and coasters. The collection is decorative and practical.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71T11xokGfL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Senegalo","source_asin":"B09V9CL3ZB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-620962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V9CL3ZB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V9CL3ZB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
